{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/L1f3663FWVxHG_jM8Y8JFA","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:51:28.258104+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/L1f3663FWVxHG_jM8Y8JFA","html":"<div><p><span><font><span>根据《关于组织开展</span></font><font><span>2</span></font></span><span><span>02</span></span><span><font><span>6</span></font></span><span><font><span>年江西中医药大学</span></font><font><span>“优秀大学生学科夏令营活动”的通知》精神，为吸引全国优秀大学生报考江西中医药大学附属医院儿科，激发医学本科生对中医儿科学习和研究的兴趣，并为今后能在江西中医药大学附属医院继续深造奠定良好基础，江西中医药大学附属医院儿科拟于</span></font><font><span>202</span></font></span><span><font><span>6</span></font></span><span><font><span>年</span></font></span><span><span>8</span></span><span><font><span>月中旬举办以</span></font><font><span>“‘医路同行，同心童梦’旴江儿科夏令营”为主题的</span></font><font><span>202</span></font></span><span><font><span>6</span></font></span><span><font><span>年优秀大学生暑期夏令营活动。具体工作方案如下：</span></font></span></p><p><b><span><font><span>一、申请基本资格条件</span></font></span></b></p><p><span><font><span>1.</span></font><font><span>有医学相关专业背景，对中医儿科有浓厚的兴趣，愿意从事中医儿科临床医疗工作或基础研究工作的</span></font><font><span>202</span></font></span><span><font><span>6</span></font></span><span><font><span>年或</span></font><font><span>2</span></font></span><span><span>02</span></span><span><font><span>7</span></font></span><span><font><span>年应届本科毕业生；</span></font></span></p><p><span><span>2</span></span><span><font><span>.</span></font><font><span>具有良好的品德、身心健康，学习成绩优秀，学习成绩在所在专业年级排名靠前，专业必修课成绩均为及格以上，科研能力较强、英语水平良好；</span></font></span></p><p><span><span>3</span></span><span><font><span>.</span></font><font><span>本科阶段有突出学术成果、论文或特殊专业特长者；或在全国、地区重大科学研究、专业技能竞赛中获奖者；或具备推荐免试攻读研究生优先。</span></font></span></p><p><b><span><font><span>二、申请材料</span></font></span></b></p><p><span><font><span>1</span></font></span><span><span>.</span></span><span><font><span>本人有效二代身份证件和学生证（扫描件）各一份；</span></font></span></p><p><span><font><span>2</span></font></span><span><span>.</span></span><span><font><span>《江西中医药大学附属医院儿科</span></font><font><span>202</span></font></span><span><font><span>6</span></font></span><span><font><span>年优秀大学生夏令营申请表》一份（附件</span></font><font><span>1</span></font><font><span>）；</span></font></span></p><p><span><font><span>3</span></font></span><span><span>.</span></span><span><font><span>在校期间历年学习成绩单及成绩排名证明一份，并由所在学校或院系教务部门加盖公章（若因假期无法加盖公章者，需提供学校官网成绩查询界面截图）；</span></font></span></p><p><span><font><span>4</span></font></span><span><span>.</span></span><span><font><span>大学英语四级或六级考试成绩单一份；</span></font></span></p><p><span><font><span>5</span></font></span><span><span>.</span></span><span><font><span>有学术成果（包括公开发表论文、出版著作、获得专利、获得学术科技奖项、承担课题或者其他具有学术水平的工作成果）者，提供学术成果证明一份；</span></font></span></p><p><span><font><span>6</span></font></span><span><span>.</span></span><span><font><span>有获得各类荣誉、表彰、奖励证书者，提供材料一份；</span></font></span></p><p><span><font><span>7</span></font></span><span><span>.</span></span><span><font><span>《江西中医药大学附属医院儿科</span></font><font><span>202</span></font></span><span><font><span>6</span></font></span><span><font><span>年优秀大学生夏令营安全责任告知书》一份（需手写签字）（附件</span></font></span><span><span>2</span></span><span><font><span>）。</span></font></span></p><p><span><font><span>申请人务必保证所提交申请材料的真实性和准确性，若有虚报、谎报等不端行为，一经查实，将取消入营资格。</span></font></span></p><p><b><span><font><span>三、申请流程</span></font></span></b></p><p><span><font><span>1.</span></font><font><span>请将申请材料（</span></font><font><span>1-</span></font></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><font><span>项）扫描后合并为一个</span></font><font><span>PDF</span></font><font><span>文档电子版，文件名命名为“中医儿科夏令营</span></font><font><span>-</span></font><font><span>在读学校</span></font></span><span><span>-</span></span><span><font><span>专业</span></font><font><span>-</span></font><font><span>姓名”（例：中医儿科夏令营</span></font><font><span>-</span></font><font><span>江西中医药大学</span></font></span><span><span>-</span></span><span><font><span>针灸推拿学</span></font><font><span>-</span></font><font><span>张</span></font><font><span>XX</span></font><font><span>）为标题发送至邮箱</span></font><font><span>3151157628@qq.com</span></font><font><span>；</span></font></span></p><p><span><font><span>2.</span></font><font><span>报名截止时间：</span></font><font><span>2026</span></font><font><span>年</span></font></span><span><font><span>8</span></font></span><span><font><span>月</span></font></span><span><font><span>1</span></font></span><span><font><span>日</span></font></span><span><font><span>20</span></font></span><span><font><span>:00</span></font><font><span>；</span></font></span></p><p><span><font><span>3.</span></font><font><span>经审核获夏令营营员资格者，江西中医药大学附属医院中医儿科夏令营活动小组将以电子邮件或电话形式于</span></font></span><span><font><span>8</span></font></span><span><font><span>月</span></font></span><span><font><span>1</span></font></span><span><font><span>日</span></font><font><span>24:00</span></font><font><span>前直接通知到本人。</span></font></span></p><p><span><font><span>4</span></font></span><span><span>.</span></span><span><font><span>入营</span></font></span><span><font><span>报到</span></font></span><span><font><span>时，请准备好</span></font><font><span>1</span></font><font><span>份纸质版申请材料（</span></font><font><span>1</span></font></span><span><span>-7</span></span><span><font><span>项）。</span></font></span></p><p><b><span><font><span>四、夏令营活动安排</span></font></span></b></p><p><b><span><font><span>活动形式：</span></font></span></b><span><font><span>线下形式开展。</span></font></span></p><p><b><span><font><span>活动时间：</span></font></span></b><span><span>8</span></span><span><font><span>月</span></font><font><span>10</span></font><font><span>日</span></font><font><span>-</span></font></span><span><span>8</span></span><span><font><span>月</span></font><font><span>1</span></font></span><span><font><span>3</span></font></span><span><font><span>日（周</span></font></span><span><font><span>一</span></font></span><span><font><span>-</span></font><font><span>周</span></font></span><span><font><span>四</span></font></span><span><font><span>）</span></font></span></p><p><b><span><font><span>（一）报到</span></font></span></b></p><p><span><font><span>时间：</span></font><font><span>202</span></font></span><span><font><span>6</span></font></span><span><font><span>年</span></font></span><span><span>8</span></span><span><font><span>月</span></font></span><span><font><span>10</span></font></span><span><font><span>日（周</span></font></span><span><font><span>一</span></font></span><span><font><span>）下午</span></font><font><span>14:30-20:00</span></font><font><span>。</span></font></span></p><p><span><font><span>地点：江西省南昌市东湖区八一大道</span></font><font><span>4</span></font></span><span><span>45</span></span><span><font><span>号江西中医药大学附属医院</span></font></span><span><font><span>综合楼</span></font><font><span>22</span></font><font><span>楼</span></font></span><span><font><span>儿科住院部。</span></font></span></p><p><b><span><font><span>（二）夏令营活动安排</span></font></span></b></p><p><span><font><span>1.</span></font></span><b><span><font><span>开营仪式</span></font></span></b></p><p><span><font><span>202</span></font></span><span><font><span>6</span></font></span><span><font><span>年</span></font></span><span><span>8</span></span><span><font><span>月</span></font><font><span>1</span></font></span><span><font><span>1</span></font></span><span><font><span>日上午，在江西中医药大学附属医院会议室举行。</span></font></span></p><p><span><font><span>2.</span></font></span><b><span><font><span>夏令营活动</span></font></span></b><b><span><font><span>及导师见面会</span></font></span></b></p><p><span><font><span>202</span></font></span><span><font><span>6</span></font></span><span><font><span>年</span></font></span><span><span>8</span></span><span><font><span>月</span></font><font><span>1</span></font></span><span><font><span>1</span></font></span><span><font><span>日下午</span></font><font><span>-</span></font></span><span><span>8</span></span><span><font><span>月</span></font><font><span>1</span></font></span><span><font><span>3</span></font></span><span><font><span>日</span></font></span><span><font><span>上</span></font></span><span><font><span>午，具体时间及活动安排同科室联络人确认。</span></font></span></p><p><span><font><span>3.</span></font></span><b><span><font><span>闭营仪式</span></font></span></b></p><p><span><span>202</span></span><span><font><span>6</span></font></span><span><font><span>年</span></font></span><span><span>8</span></span><span><font><span>月</span></font><font><span>1</span></font></span><span><font><span>3</span></font></span><span><font><span>日</span></font></span><span><font><span>上</span></font></span><span><font><span>午，在江西中医药大学附属医院会议室举行。</span></font></span></p><p><b><span><font><span>五、营员待遇</span></font></span></b></p><p><span><font><span>1.</span></font><font><span>伙食：我院将为夏令营营员提供夏令营期间的就餐。</span></font></span></p><p><span><font><span>2.</span></font><font><span>交通及住宿：在营期间住宿（即</span></font></span><span><font><span>10</span></font></span><span><font><span>日晚、</span></font><font><span>1</span></font></span><span><font><span>1</span></font></span><span><font><span>日晚、</span></font><font><span>1</span></font></span><span><font><span>2</span></font></span><span><font><span>日晚）费用由我院承担。外地院校的学生请自行预订往返车票，费用自理。</span></font></span></p><p><b><span><font><span>六、纪律要求</span></font></span></b></p><p><span><font><span>夏令营营员必须遵守我院相关规定，按照统一安排参加夏令营活动；报到前提交</span></font><font><span>《江西中医药大学附属医院儿科</span></font><font><span>202</span></font></span><span><font><span>6</span></font></span><span><font><span>年优秀大学生夏令营安全责任告知书》</span></font><font><span>。</span></font></span></p><p><b><span><font><span>七、营员享受的待遇</span></font></span></b></p><p><span><font><span>获得优秀营员者，如获得所在学校的研究生推荐免试资格，报考中医儿科专业、相同学位类型可优先拟录取为我校推荐免试硕士研究生；如未获得所在学校的研究生推荐免试资格，但通过参加全国统考硕士研究生，报考中医儿科专业、相同学位类型，考试成绩达到我校当年该专业复试基本分数线（含总分、单科分数）标准的优秀营员，同等条件下优先推荐。</span></font></span></p><p><b><span><font><span>八、公示和监督</span></font></span></b></p><p><span><font><span>优秀营员名单将在本院网站进行公示。</span></font></span></p><p><span><font><span>学生对优秀营员选拔名单如有疑问，请于公示期间以书面形式向江西中医药大学附属医院中医儿科提出。</span></font></span></p><p><span><font><span>本次活动解释权归江西中医药大学附属医院中医儿科夏令营活动小组和监察小组。</span></font></span></p><p><b><span><font><span>九、联系方式</span></font></span></b><b><span><span> </span></span></b></p><p><span><font><span>联系电话：</span></font></span><span><span>0791-86363183</span></span><span><font><span>，</span></font><font><span>1</span></font></span><span><span>8720</span></span><span><font><span>764008</span></font></span></p><p><span><font><span>邮箱：</span></font><font><span>3151157628@qq.com</span></font></span></p><p><span><font><span>联系人：</span></font></span><span><font><span>肖</span></font></span><span><font><span>老师</span></font></span></p><p><span><font><span>详细地址：江西省南昌市东湖区八一大道</span></font><font><span>4</span></font></span><span><span>45</span></span><span><font><span>号江西中医药大学附属医院儿科</span></font></span></p><section><span><span>附件下载链接：https://www.jxszyy.com/channel/dept_29/80/33455.html</span></span></section><section><span><span>文稿：张迪</span></span></section><section><span><span>排版：陈坚强</span></span></section><section><span><span>审核：刘英</span></span></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"004fb864c0a09cb9a71fb8ce8f157e270ca01bab4f0157f3276bded52964936e","textLength":1869,"sourceSha256":"58368d3e45f79dd6ba6349e99b4e515faeb1957acaedb67334df20a3ddd7e0f2","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-d02c92b0358ecca1d147","title":"2026年江西中医药大学附属医院儿科“2026年优秀大学生暑期夏令营”活动通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:51:28.258104+00:00"}
